(text "Switches: UP, DOWN, LEFT, RIGHT seen by the rider. Each switch uses a diagonal pad pair.\nPushing the stick straight in closes all four; the firmware reads that chord as the centre press.\nJ1 goes to J4 on the control board through a straight 5-pin JST SH cable (pin 1 to pin 1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06186877-98c5-5b3b-8b98-afe49d2e690f"))
